{"ts":"2026-08-30T19:26:29.805Z","type":"finding","frontier":"readiness-planning-publication-version-key-main","claim":"Independent verification passed: the verifier loaded the genuine removed veto from base and ran it against the candidate key over all 25 ordered publication-state pairs — 25/25 agree, 0 weaker; four mutations (drop status, drop epoch, constant component, drop generation) each turn it red; probe-unavailable mixed pairs are stricter, never weaker. Read cost unchanged and measured: 824 publication winner reads base and candidate over the identical 1000-call sequence. Identity observable 26/26 and still discriminating. Pre-change bounds reproduced on a clean base tree (1724 builds / 824 reads / 344.8 per second) and identical on the candidate, both asserted with <= so a regression goes red. No sealed constraint weakened. STATEMENT ACCURACY recorded, not edited: (c) the statement's '5180 of 5180, 344.8 per second' pairs a 3000-call measurement with a rate from a different sequence and is arithmetically inconsistent (5180/15 s = 345.3) and unreceipted; (d) the '2420 builds per second' publication-churn figure is unreceipted. Both are real measurements from the implementer's rig, but the receipted bounds are 1724/824/344.8 and future statements should use those. HARNESS HEADER defects to fix directly: (a) budgets-and-cadence-unchanged is labelled green on HEAD but is red at base with a missing-method TypeError, so only the rate receipt is a genuine both-sides control; (b) the header says 8 receipts red on HEAD, actually 11 of 12. Harness fidelity caveat: the 11 base-red scenarios fail via missing-method TypeError, which the template disqualifies as proof, so the discriminating power is the oracle plus mutations, verified directly. MY OWN PREMISE REFUTED: I told the implementer and the verifier that formation-release-handoff-consumer-parity and -interaction-registry are inherited-red at base; on a clean clone they are 13/13 and 6/6 GREEN. The registry suite's only failure is its no-owner-semantics-change scenario asserting an empty git diff HEAD -- src, unsatisfiable for any uncommitted source change and green post-commit; audit:architecture-slices is separately and genuinely red at base.","kind":"verifier-approval","evidence":"subagent:version-key-review-1","rulesOut":null,"verification":{"schemaVersion":2,"scope":"candidate","fingerprint":"sha256:3f1b9f5a1fdc32ee82cf7e3d0763a7856faa74f16548d68f9a3c96466fe06ad0","baseCommit":"833ef1685bc8cfa06d08dc4a7d66368f6504adea","paths":["scripts/quest-evidence-readiness-planning-publication-version-key.js","src/control-plane/control-plane-readiness-publication-planning-resolution.js","src/control-plane/control-plane-readiness-publication-planning-snapshot.js","src/control-plane/membership-publication-coordinator-reads.js","test/control-plane/cl-033-epoch-probe-node-scope.test.js","test/control-plane/cl-033-planning-projection-memo.test.js","test/control-plane/cl-034-planning-snapshot-merge-memo.test.js","test/control-plane/readiness-planning-publication-version-key.test.js","test/shards/primary-classes.json","test/shards/resource-classes.json","test/shards/subsystem-classes.json"],"sourcePaths":["scripts/quest-evidence-readiness-planning-publication-version-key.js","src/control-plane/control-plane-readiness-publication-planning-resolution.js","src/control-plane/control-plane-readiness-publication-planning-snapshot.js","src/control-plane/membership-publication-coordinator-reads.js","test/control-plane/cl-033-epoch-probe-node-scope.test.js","test/control-plane/cl-033-planning-projection-memo.test.js","test/control-plane/cl-034-planning-snapshot-merge-memo.test.js","test/control-plane/readiness-planning-publication-version-key.test.js","test/shards/primary-classes.json","test/shards/resource-classes.json","test/shards/subsystem-classes.json"],"firstAttemptIndex":2,"lastAttemptIndex":2},"regressionClassification":null,"scopePressureClassification":null}
